[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10203.99, "timestamp": "02:50:03", "text": "他在说什么？那并非如此"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10206.19, "timestamp": "02:50:06", "text": "看起来像一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10211.75, "timestamp": "02:50:11", "text": "呃，那个稍后回来（BRB）的主播。啊，滚开。这"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10214.429, "timestamp": "02:50:14", "text": "稍后回来"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10218.23, "timestamp": "02:50:18", "text": "主播。哦，该死的。是吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10222.23, "timestamp": "02:50:22", "text": "我变成了什么？一个 BRB 主播？耶稣。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10226.91, "timestamp": "02:50:26", "text": "我的天哪。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10231.63, "timestamp": "02:50:31", "text": "呃，总之，伙计们，我们过得怎么样？你好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10236.23, "timestamp": "02:50:36", "text": "你好。我刚吃完饭，我也不知道。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10240.63, "timestamp": "02:50:40", "text": "你只需要吃就行了。是的，我刚吃过午饭。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10243.75, "timestamp": "02:50:43", "text": "需要去"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10245.83, "timestamp": "02:50:45", "text": "是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10254.309, "timestamp": "02:50:54", "text": "嗯，直到那些运动健将来了为止。你是什​​么"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10259.91, "timestamp": "02:50:59", "text": "我的意思是，继续玩你之前玩的游戏。"}]